#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kate; plugins are additional functions for the &kate; editor. They can add "
"extra menus and shortcuts, and extend &kate;'s features. You can install as "
"many or as few as you like, from within &kate;. Open &kate;'s configuration "
"dialog with <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>"
"Configure &kate;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Select <menuchoice><guimenu>"
"Application</guimenu><guimenuitem>Plugins</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"to choose the wanted plugins."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More information on using &kate; and enabling the plugins you want is available "
"in the &kate; handbook."
msgstr "សម្រាប់​ព័ត៌មាន​បន្ថែម​អំពី​ការ​ប្រើប្រាស់ Kate និង​អនុញ្ញាត​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​ដែល​អ្នក​ត្រូវការ មាន​ក្នុង​សៀវភៅ​ដៃ Kate ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "The plugins installed in this handbook are:"
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​ដែល​ដំឡើង​ក្នុង​សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​គឺ ៖"

